        "node_id": "n_1_26352d",
        "thought_text": "Revised Thought-1: Instead of iterating through all possible ranges and recalculating the sum and product for each, use prefix sums and products to efficiently determine if any range's sum equals its product. This approach reduces the complexity significantly.",
