        "node_id": "n_4_f21b81",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2 (revised): Instead of iterating through all possible ranges directly, use a dictionary to store the difference between prefix sums and the logarithm of prefix products (to handle large numbers). This allows for efficient checking of matching sums and products without recalculating them for every range.",
